<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (RoBERTa\072\040A\040Robustly\040Optimized\040BERT\040Pretraining\040Approach)
/Author (Yinhan\040Liu\054\040Myle\040Ott\054\040Naman\040Goyal\054\040Jingfei\040Du\054\040Mandar\040Joshi\054\040Danqi\040Chen\054\040Omer\040Levy\054\040Michael\040Lewis\054\040Luke\040Zettlemoyer\054\040Veselin\040Stoyanov)
/Subject (Language\040model\040pretraining\040has\040led\040to\040significant\040performance\040gains\040but\040careful\040comparison\040between\040different\040approaches\040is\040challenging\056\040Training\040is\040computationally\040expensive\054\040often\040done\040on\040private\040datasets\040of\040different\040sizes\054\040and\054\040as\040we\040will\040show\054\040hyperparameter\040choices\040have\040significant\040impact\040on\040the\040final\040results\056\040We\040present\040a\040replication\040study\040of\040BERT\040pretraining\040\050Devlin\040et\040al\056\054\0402019\051\040that\040carefully\040measures\040the\040impact\040of\040many\040key\040hyperparameters\040and\040training\040data\040size\056\040We\040find\040that\040BERT\040was\040significantly\040undertrained\054\040and\040can\040match\040or\040exceed\040the\040performance\040of\040every\040model\040published\040after\040it\056\040Our\040best\040model\040achieves\040state\055of\055the\055art\040results\040on\040GLUE\054\040RACE\040and\040SQuAD\056\040These\040results\040highlight\040the\040importance\040of\040previously\040overlooked\040design\040choices\054\040and\040raise\040questions\040about\040the\040source\040of\040recently\040reported\040improvements\056\040We\040release\040our\040models\040and\040code\056)
/Keywords (26\040Jul\0402019\054\040arXiv\072\040Computation\040and\040Language)
>>
endobj
